---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/site-layout.astro';
import Bird from '../assets/bird.svg';
---

<SiteLayout title="Playground · Birdie" description="The Birdie browser playground is planned. Explore proposed examples and the language handbook while it takes shape.">
  <section class="play-intro wrap" aria-labelledby="play-heading">
    <span class="status-label">Planned</span>
    <h1 id="play-heading">A place to<br />try your ideas.</h1>
    <p>The browser playground will let you write and run Birdie here. First, we’re building the language and its interpreter.</p>
    <div class="play-placeholder">
      <Bird width={100} height={106} aria-hidden="true" />
      <div>
        <h2>This bird isn’t flying just yet.</h2>
        <p>There’s no runtime connected. You can already explore the proposed syntax and work through a few familiar algorithms.</p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/docs/examples/">Explore the examples <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/docs/roadmap/">What needs to happen first <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
